<%- include('partials/head') %>
<section class="hero"><div class="hero-in">
  <h1>Ride together.<br>Share the cost.</h1>
  <p>Carpool rides all across India. Share fuel and toll costs, and never let a seat go empty.</p>
  <%- include('partials/searchbar') %>
</div></section>

<section class="trio">
  <div><h3>Travel everywhere</h3><p>Thousands of city-to-city carpool rides across India.</p></div>
  <div><h3>Prices like nowhere</h3><p>Shared costs keep fares lower than bus or train.</p></div>
  <div><h3>Ride with confidence</h3><p>Travel with members who have verified profiles.</p></div>
</section>

<section class="wrap">
  <h2>Top carpool rides</h2>
  <div class="routes">
    <% routes.forEach(r => { %>
      <a class="route" href="/search?from=<%= r.from %>&to=<%= r.to %>">
        <span><%= r.from %> <i>→</i> <%= r.to %></span><b>₹<%= r.price %></b>
      </a>
    <% }) %>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="split wrap">
  <div>
    <h2>Never miss a carpool!</h2>
    <p>Drivers often publish rides just 3 days before departure. Set an alert and get an email as soon as a new ride is published.</p>
    <form class="alert" action="/alerts" method="post">
      <input name="from" list="cities" placeholder="From" required>
      <input name="to" list="cities" placeholder="To" required>
      <input type="email" name="email" placeholder="Email" required>
      <button class="btn">Create alert</button>
    </form>
  </div>
  <div class="panel">
    <h2>Share your ride. Cut your costs.</h2>
    <p>Turn your empty seats into lower travel costs. Publish your ride and passengers will share your fuel and toll expenses.</p>
    <a class="btn" href="/offer">Share your ride</a>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="quote wrap">
  <blockquote>“Carpooling is great: I pay a little to get there on time, in comfort and in AC. And it helps the driver when they're travelling alone.”</blockquote>
  <cite>Amit, from Pune</cite>
</section>

<section class="wrap" id="help">
  <h2>Carpool Help Centre</h2>
  <div class="faq">
    <details><summary>How do I book a ride?</summary><p>Search for your destination, pick a date and choose the ride that suits you. Some rides can be booked instantly; others need the driver's approval.</p></details>
    <details><summary>How do I publish a ride?</summary><p>Go to Offer a ride and enter the departure, arrival, date, time, seats and price. Choose automatic or manual booking approval, then publish.</p></details>
    <details><summary>How do I cancel a ride?</summary><p>You can cancel a booking from the “My rides” page. The sooner you cancel, the more time the driver has to find a new passenger.</p></details>
    <details><summary>What are the benefits of carpooling?</summary><p>It's cheaper on longer distances, fewer cars means less pollution, and you travel with only a few people.</p></details>
    <details><summary>How much does a ride cost?</summary><p>It depends on distance, time and demand. The driver sets the price per seat. A <%= fee*100 %>% service fee is added at booking.</p></details>
    <details><summary>How do I start carpooling?</summary><p>Create a free account, add some basic details and start booking or publishing rides.</p></details>
  </div>
</section>
<%- include('partials/foot') %>
